WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:01.930
No way!!

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.890
Our...

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:05.860
My...

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:07.770
...field!

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:21.870
It's dawn. Let's get out of here.

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:24.330
So we're done repenting?

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:28.670
Let's get some sleep while we're at it. Fatigue is dangerous to the skin.

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:30.340
We must depart at once.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:31.670
Why?

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:35.430
The students are waiting for me to make their warm cafeteria food!

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:38.350
Okay, beautiful jail break!

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:39.680
Jail breaking is...

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:42.430
Stripping and king-break-jail!!

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:45.190
Raaaaad, yeah!!

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:49.270
Hey, you guys!

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:49.940
What're you doing!?

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:05.830
In Yokohama's foreign exchange market yesterday,

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:07.790
the yen has dropped from 95 to 88 per dollar, and...

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:12.000
Our field...

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:14.920
It's delicious...

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.140
Damn! Who... yummy... could have done this!?

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:25.390
Our farm... Yum... It's scrumptious!

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:29.020
But now we have nothing else to eat...

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:32.650
Maybe we shouldn't have...

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:36.150
Delicious...

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:41.700
Delicious... So delicious...

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:47.620
Man, I'm stuffed!

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:49.290
Ugh, my hands are sticky!

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:51.170
Mine too!

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:52.960
Thanks!

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:54.510
Me too!

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:04.350
Man, this is broken...

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:07.560
Well then, here's a request from Kimura-san...

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:09.520
C...

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:10.940
Cu...

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:16.320
Cucumbers! I smell them! Maybe there's still some left in our field!

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:18.450
Really!?

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:20.070
Yay, let's go see!

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:22.070
Herc, Kamaboko, let's go!

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:23.950
Um, just now...

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:26.540
To...

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:27.790
To?

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:29.500
To... Um...

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:31.920
Uh, um...

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:34.420
Come on, let's go.

00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:39.550
<i>Something feels very familiar...</i>

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:45.560
<i>So believe that your greatest loss is your farm, huh?</i>

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:50.020
Henriette-sama is gloomy again today.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:53.060
I don't like Milky Holmes at all.

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:57.280
Let's beat them to a pulp this time!

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:00.530
Yes. If we do that, she should cheer up.

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:05.910
Henriette-sama, giving us a beautiful smile of a goddess...

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:09.370
Just imagining it makes me...!

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:11.460
No!

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:12.370
No!!

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:16.170
My tension is stretched to the max!!

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:26.010
What should we do from now on?

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:29.890
Everyone, it's fine! Cheer up! I'm sure things will work out!

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.850
I'm hungry!

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:34.440
Okay, it's time to work! Let's get jobs, people!

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:35.900
Good idea, Nero!

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:37.150
Jobs...

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:39.110
We're counting on you again, Herc!

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:48.990
I'm sorry!

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:54.080
Flowers! Beautiful flowers~!

00:03:56.960 --> 00:04:00.880
You're a great model, Herc-kun! Smoky! Explosion!!

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:02.340
This I'll draw!

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:05.430
P-Painful...

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:08.890
I'm not expecting too much from Cordelia,

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:11.390
but if I deposit both Sher's and Herc's paychecks into my account,

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:14.140
then punch a hole through Greece's national debt with it all...

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:17.650
Ooh, I can buy a new house for us within two months! Go me!

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:20.400
Good work today.

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.490
Oh, Herc-kun, did you know?

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:24.740
You are one wonderful subject.

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:28.080
This is for you. It's my pride and joy.

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.200
For me...?

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.040
Thank you so much!

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.380
I got a bag of washed-out chicken bones!

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:39.300
I also did my best to sell some flowers!

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.550
Being a model is quite tiring...

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:44.630
Good work!

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:46.050
What did you do, Nero?

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:48.260
O-Oh, I did just great!

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:49.680
What kind of job?

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:52.680
A-A job fitting for someone like me.

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:54.350
My dream job, you see!

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:55.770
What's that?

00:04:56.350 --> 00:05:00.020
It's a rough sketch of me by Mr. Cherry, an artist.

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:03.820
T-This is...?

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:06.490
What the heck?

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:09.370
These are the eyes, and this is the nose, no?

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.410
What're you saying? You're pointing at the mouth!

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:15.620
You should've gotten your pay, not this!

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:17.120
Man, you're so helpless.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:18.460
No way...

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:30.850
W-What was that?

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:35.430
Could you give that picture to me?

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:40.020
It looks just like my first love whom I parted from a long time ago!

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:46.490
It's been eighty years since then...

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:47.740
Eighty years?

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:52.200
Her name was Higatha. Higatha Christie!

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:56.870
<i>Wait, Drill-san!</i>

00:05:56.870 --> 00:06:00.630
Higatha was a shy girl, so she always wore a mask.

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:02.500
Just like that mask!!

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:04.760
Really?

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:08.630
Amazing! She's just like Kokoro-chan!

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:11.220
She was a kind girl.

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:13.430
Looks like he has more to say!

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:15.890
Though his story would probably take more than eighty years to tell...

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:18.770
That's right! My grandfather was long-lived as well!

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:21.150
She helped wounded cranes...

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:25.530
She even saved a whale when it got washed up in a storm...

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:27.070
Huh?

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:28.650
Amazing!

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:30.200
Let's go home.

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:32.950
Let's go!

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:34.740
I'm hungry!

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:38.000
I have a sickening amount of money, if that's what you're after.

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:42.920
But on that fateful day...

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:46.510
We went to see the tombs of Yokohama's royal family,

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:49.220
wanting to look at King Khufuhama's pyramid for ourselves.

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:51.300
<i>It's a wonderful pyramid.</i>

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:53.430
<i>But you're even more wonderful.</i>

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:02.270
Really?

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:04.150
What happened to Higatha-san!?

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:04.820
Hey!

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:08.150
We became separated for life since then.

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:12.030
I couldn't find Higatha, no matter what I did!

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:13.620
I feel so bad for you!

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:16.200
Since I couldn't find her, no matter where I looked,

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:21.210
I resigned myself as a bachelor for the rest of my life, without even a single picture of her!

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:25.000
So please, at least let me find repose in that picture with the days I have left!

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:26.710
If that's the case, then...

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:28.170
Here.

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:29.670
Hold it right there!

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:34.850
I won't give it to you for free. This picture could bring me some much-needed funds.

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:36.850
Funds...?

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:40.600
My name is Yuzurizaki Nero. "Yuzuru" means "To give".

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:42.440
That makes me a collector.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:45.060
Which means that it's okay to give to me!

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:49.150
I see, I see now! How about this then?

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:55.070
<i>10,000,000!?</i>

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:58.040
No way!!

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:01.370
What's that?

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:02.710
A children's bank note?

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:04.830
It's nothing! Memo, memo!

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:06.540
Looks like it!

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:08.050
Me too!

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:10.130
I said it's a memo!

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:12.300
But that could be...

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:13.760
Herc, you keep quiet!

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:17.640
Hey, how about a little more, if you want this picture that much?

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:22.230
Oh, that's it! Sushi! Add some sushi too!

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:25.520
A hundred... No, one thousand pieces of first-class sushi!

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:27.270
Very well.

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:29.110
A thousand pieces of sushi!

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:32.030
Yay! Sushi!

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:35.740
Without wasabi!

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:37.200
Hey, Sher, everyone, I―

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:39.370
Oh, boss? This is Drill.

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:43.410
Please bring, using the freshest fish caught from Yokohama Bay,

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:47.290
one thousand pieces of the finest sushi you can make to Too-Much-Of-The-Port-Is-Visible Hill Park. And make it quick!

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:49.880
Oh, make sure to add ice to keep it fresh.

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:52.260
You are!

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:53.720
You're great, Nero!

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.800
Um, everyone...

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:01.060
Wait, sushi!!

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:02.850
Higatha!!

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:04.230
Wait for me! Hey!

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:06.690
Stop!!

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:08.940
Please wait, sushi!

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:15.860
Hey there!

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:18.240
Huh? I can see something!

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:22.870
I'm working hard to save up for my daughter's surgery, oh yeah!

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:32.420
Also, sushi made by a sushi boss is superb~!!

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:34.210
This man was raising his young daughter all by himself, but the daughter came down with a sickness and needed a surgery that costs 9,990,000 yen, which is why he eagerly started working, and once his daughter is cured, he wants to let her run wild and free through a grass-covered plain being swept gently by the breeze!

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:38.300
I want to eat some fish!

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:40.300
The boss must have it hard too, huh?

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:42.310
Cordelia-san, just now...

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:45.890
It's getting away! It's flying out of the park!

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:47.140
Sushi!

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:52.150
Nero, Sher, Cordelia-san! Please listen to me!

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:54.990
Listen!!

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:09.920
My sushi!!

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.040
It's <i>our</i>  sushi!

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:13.420
Higatha!!

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:19.300
Wait for me, my wife! I'll be there for the delivery, I promise!

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:21.390
I'll be there right away!

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:24.810
Oh, no! The brakes are shot!

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:27.310
Oh my god!!

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:28.810
I'm hungry!

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:31.440
Ten million yen!!

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:35.690
Yay!

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:38.110
Come on! Come on!

00:10:38.140 --> 00:10:40.740
No! It won't stop!!

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:42.120
The picture!

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:43.580
Turn right!

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:46.410
What!?

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:48.080
We've gotta turn right!

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.540
Jesus!!

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:52.960
Something's coming!

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:57.090
No!!

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:02.640
My god!!

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:04.010
No!!

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:10.890
NO!!

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:12.270
Up!

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:21.570
Diplomat phone home.

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:25.490
Just a little more!

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:29.410
Sher, Nero, that's probably our T... To...

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:31.920
I can't remember!

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:32.960
Almost there!

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:41.930
Stop!

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:47.760
Wait!!

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:50.140
Hey! I have something important to say...

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:55.700
Sushi is my life, my <i>raison d'être</i>~

00:11:55.700 --> 00:11:57.070
Eh? Drill-san!

00:11:57.520 --> 00:12:01.280
Please wait! Here's your 1000 pieces of first-class sushi!

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.500
It's a whale!

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:17.790
Great...

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:23.840
We got a tip.

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:27.930
So this is the car that got out of control with the stupid Milky Holmes on it?

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:30.720
That's a diplomat number. It's out of our jurisdiction.

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:33.600
Even if there were stowaways, there wouldn't be anything wrong with it.

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:35.560
So we've wasted our time. Let's head back then.

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:42.650
I thought I'd finally be able to punish those stupid retards for a traffic violation!

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:49.620
Yes, yes! My wife, you did great! Good job!

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:53.500
So you got washed up here in last night's storm, eh!?

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:58.750
Hey, move it! There's something really important underneath you right now!

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:01.550
Yes, I know the stars are pretty! But still!

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:03.380
Move, I beg of you!

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.340
Please move!

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:08.760
For our sushi! For Mr. Drill's memories!

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:11.390
Boss, how's your daughter?

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:14.060
She'll be okay now, thanks to you.

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:15.020
Higatha!

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:16.480
Why'd you ask?

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:19.980
For our sushi, and for Mr. Drill's afterlife souvenir!

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:22.730
We need that picture!

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:25.070
It won't even budge!

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:32.410
Toys...

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:42.630
We're the Phantom Thief Empire!

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:46.010
Tonight shall be your final night alive!

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:48.890
Time for a little spanking, yo!

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:51.600
For Arsène-sama's sake―!

00:13:58.690 --> 00:13:59.860
Everyone!

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:00.980
Um...

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:04.900
Our... Toys...

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:06.700
Now we can eat our sushi!

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:08.320
You mean, this sushi over here?

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:10.740
Itadakimasu!

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:12.830
Yummy!

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:16.910
Let's save some for Kamaboko too!

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:17.580
We should!

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:20.130
Boss, you should go! Go save your daughter!

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:20.880
Yeah!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:23.000
Herc, come eat, or it'll all be gone!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:23.670
Right.

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:25.210
Itadakimasu.

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:29.180
Tunaargfh! Whelk*gulp*! Prawnomnom!

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:33.010
Octopus! Fatty tuna! Come to Mamarghsh!

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:36.640
My sushi! My sushi!

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:38.600
Yummy!

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:40.850
Higatha...

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:48.150
That's...

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:53.910
That mask is...!

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:55.540
It can't be!

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:56.290
Drill-san!

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:57.120
Higatha!

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:00.460
Dear...

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:03.210
Drill!!

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:05.300
Higatha!!

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:07.920
I've been looking for you for so long!

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:11.640
Me too! A clue finally came to me after eighty years,

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:13.470
so I made my way to Yokohama.

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:16.560
But then I was kidnapped by pirates...

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:19.140
I see! That happens too!

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:22.980
And then a whale came up and capsized the pirates' ship!

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:24.650
That happens too!

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:28.110
He saved me... Do you remember him?

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:29.990
That baby whale from that day!

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:31.530
Oh, from that day!?

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:36.830
I see! So you've grown up and gone to save people's lives!

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:39.080
Higatha!

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:40.210
Dear!

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:42.540
Dammit, this is so moving...

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:45.880
Man, I'm stuffed!

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:47.590
Let's go home then.

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:52.800
What?

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:56.970
Ahh... I'm really happy for you, Drill-san.

00:15:59.100 --> 00:15:59.930
Here...

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:05.190
What's this?

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:07.360
For the sushi. From Drill-san.

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:10.150
T-This much!?

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:12.530
Thank you! Thank you!

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:14.450
Now I can pay for my daughter's surgery!

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:15.200
Nero.

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:18.160
The change...

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:19.120
Nero.

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:25.000
My ten million yen!

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:43.020
We'll repent until morning.

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:45.060
Ugh, so annoying...

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:48.150
The bill has passed, I take it?

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:51.280
Thank you very much, mayor.

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:01.750
Henriette-san, we're back!

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:09.380
Here you go! A cucumber!

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:12.420
Return Receive!

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:14.260
Safe!

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:20.600
G4 has apparently captured both the Phantom Thief Empire and the pirates.

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:24.230
Even the pirates? That's Kokoro-chan for you!

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:30.650
Only the police are doing the work in Yokohama. Detectives are virtually useless.

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:35.950
As such, Holmes Detective Academy shall soon be abolished.

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:39.570
Abolished?

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:41.280
It will close.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:56.340
The academy grounds will be used to erect a pavilion for the upcoming Detective Fair.

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:58.340
In order to protect the academy...

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:02.220
Do you know what could be done?

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:09.600
Kamaboko, here's a present!

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:14.940
What're you doing, Herc-san?

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:17.070
Our Toys came back.

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:18.860
To...

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:20.660
...ys?

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:22.120
What's that?

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:28.580
Toys. They are miraculous buds that swell from the hearts of the chosen.

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:31.750
Some flowers are born pure,

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:34.590
while others bloom laced with poison.

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:38.930
The Age of Detectives. The two flowers, vying for beauty.

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:42.550
Their names are the Detective and the Phantom Thief.

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:45.770
Toys!

00:18:45.770 --> 00:18:48.230
We forgot about it trying to survive!

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:50.600
But it seems like they're gone again...

00:18:50.600 --> 00:18:52.480
Why didn't you tell us about it earlier!?

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:55.650
Jeez, Herc! You're too quiet!

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:57.490
I tried to tell you so many times...

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:00.700
Toys, huh...

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:07.230
Oh, I've got it!

00:19:07.230 --> 00:19:14.170
We're detectives! So if we try hard as such, maybe we can save the academy too!

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:15.550
Though I'm not too sure...

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:17.210
Yeah, that's it!

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:18.130
Probably...

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:22.340
I don't know what to try hard at, but as detectives, we'll just do our best!

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:23.090
For now...

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:27.810
Yes. Let's join our powers and protect this academy.

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:29.730
As detectives!

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:33.270
Fight! Milky Holmes, yeah!

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:37.320
That out of the way, let's have sushi for dinner!

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:38.400
I'm in!

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:48.950
Kokoro-chan! Our academy's gonna disappear!

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:50.540
Don't call me that!

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:55.000
It doesn't matter! The one who'll be keeping peace in Yokohama is this beautiful genius girl, Akechi Kokoro―

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:57.460
Oh! Want some dried gourd sushi?

00:19:57.460 --> 00:20:00.720
Dried gourd!? There's no tuna or anything in it!?

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:01.800
There's sea cucumbers in it too.

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:03.010
Eww, that's so gross!

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:04.760
At least leave out the sea cucumbers!

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:06.550
Where'd you get sea cucumbers, anyways?

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:07.680
Hakkei Island, of course!

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:09.180
Eh? That prison island?

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:10.930
Next Time: The Colorful Tale of Hakkei Island.

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:14.440
The culprit is Kokoro! Not!!
